@@ -0,0 +1,111 @@
+.\"
+.\" This file and its contents are supplied under the terms of the
+.\" Common Development and Distribution License ("CDDL"), version 1.0.
+.\" You may only use this file in accordance with the terms of version
+.\" 1.0 of the CDDL.
+.\"
+.\" A full copy of the text of the CDDL should have accompanied this
+.\" source.  A copy of the CDDL is also available via the Internet at
+.\" http://www.illumos.org/license/CDDL.
+.\"
+.\"
+.\" Copyright 2026 isoriano1968
+.\"
+.Dd November 13, 2026
+.Dt APPLESMC 4D
+.Os
+.Sh NAME
+.Nm applesmc
+.Nd Apple System Management Controller sensor driver
+.Sh SYNOPSIS
+.Pa /dev/applesmc
+.Pp
+.Pa /dev/sensors/temperature/smc/*
+.Sh DESCRIPTION
+The
+.Nm
+driver gives read-only access to the System Management Controller
+.Pq SMC
+of Intel-based Apple Macintosh computers.
+The SMC runs the fans and the thermal protection of the machine on its own
+and keeps its measurements as four-character keys, for example
+.Sy TC0P
+.Pq CPU proximity temperature
+or
+.Sy F0Ac
+.Pq current speed of fan 0 .
+Each key has a length, a four-character type such as
+.Sy sp78 ,
+.Sy fpe2
+or
+.Sy flt ,
+and flags.
+.Pp
+The driver finds the SMC through the ACPI device
+.Sy APP0001
+and its I/O port window
+.Pq normally 0x300 to 0x31f .
+On machines without that device it does not attach.
+It never writes keys: fan control stays with the SMC.
+.Pp
+Every temperature key of type
+.Sy sp78
+or
+.Sy flt
+that reads a plausible value at attach time is registered as a kernel
+sensor and appears under
+.Pa /dev/sensors/temperature/smc/ ,
+named after its key; it can be read with the
+.Dv SENSOR_IOCTL_SCALAR
+interface of
+.In sys/sensors.h
+and is visible to the fault management framework.
+.Pp
+The character device
+.Pa /dev/applesmc
+offers every key through the following
+.Xr ioctl 2
+commands, defined in
+.In sys/applesmc.h .
+Values are returned raw, as the SMC sends them; decoding by type is left to
+the consumer.
+.Bl -tag -width Dv
+.It Dv APPLESMC_IOC_NKEYS
+Return the number of keys as a
+.Vt uint32_t .
+.It Dv APPLESMC_IOC_KEYBYIDX
+Return in
+.Fa ak_key
+the name of the key at index
+.Fa ak_index .
+.It Dv APPLESMC_IOC_KEYINFO
+Return the type, length and flags of the key
+.Fa ak_key .
+.It Dv APPLESMC_IOC_READ
+Return the type, length, flags and up to
+.Dv APPLESMC_MAXDATA
+bytes of data of the key
+.Fa ak_key .
+.El
+.Pp
+The interface is private and may change.
+.Sh FILES
+.Bl -tag -width Pa
+.It Pa /kernel/drv/amd64/applesmc
+Device driver
+.Pq x86 .
+.It Pa /kernel/drv/applesmc.conf
+Driver configuration file.
+.It Pa /dev/applesmc
+Key access.
+.It Pa /dev/sensors/temperature/smc/
+Temperature sensors.
+.El
+.Sh ARCHITECTURE
+x86
+.Sh INTERFACE STABILITY
+.Sy Uncommitted
+.Sh SEE ALSO
+.Xr ioctl 2 ,
+.Xr smcstat 8 ,
+.Xr ksensor 9E
diff --git a/usr/src/man/man8/Makefile b/usr/src/man/man8/Makefile
index 7c7d9829..cf5682a3 100644
